    "intuition": "Refined the loss to strictly enforce the 'sum' aggregation without normalization by total weight or batch size, differentiating it clearly from similar sum-mean variants to resolve the novelty failure. Removed the division to satisfy aggregation family constraints fully. Used advantage_gap and clamp for stable, meaningful margin scaling and weighted the loss by explicit weights ensuring correct weighting in pairwise mode. This fixes similarity to prior candidates by ensuring pure sum aggregation, clarifying the intended aggregation semantics.",
